    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/cff6ee7e17dec22a6d27252bc27ab337.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/cff6ee7e17dec22a6d27252bc27ab337.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/cff6ee7e17dec22a6d27252bc27ab337.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Embark on a scientific mission</strong><br>Congratulations photographer, you have been selected to participate in the exploration of the exoplanet Gliese 486B.<br>Your mission is to catalogue all the dinosaurs and other primitive creatures that live on this exoplanet.<br><br>Professor Edmee, in charge of the expedition, will be your supervisor on site and will give you your objectives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/64049f07aa32a4aae46fefb5ec24cf3e.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/64049f07aa32a4aae46fefb5ec24cf3e.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/64049f07aa32a4aae46fefb5ec24cf3e.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Photograph, catalogue, interact</strong><br>Your photos will allow us to learn more about this planet but also about the dinosaurs that lived on Earth.<br><br>Interact with the fauna to take the best pictures and discover all their behaviors.<br><br>All data will be entered into the <strong>Dinopedia</strong>.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take photos of the dinosaurs<br></li><li>Interact with the dinosaurs to see their reactions<br></li><li>Complete the &quot;Dinopedia&quot; encyclopedia<br></li><li>Find paths to new areas<br></li><li>Discover and solve the mysteries of the planet!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/69d16820f46e03fff64448aac229b586.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/69d16820f46e03fff64448aac229b586.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/69d16820f46e03fff64448aac229b586.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A peaceful mission!</strong><br>No weapons are allowed on this mission.<br>In case of danger, your vehicle will automatically leave the area to avoid any risky situations.<br>You can therefore stroll peacefully, but beware: some dinosaurs may chase after you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/ac49a21d0c9f69a7de816c1a9ebec093.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/ac49a21d0c9f69a7de816c1a9ebec093.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/ac49a21d0c9f69a7de816c1a9ebec093.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A planet full of mysteries</strong><br>It seems that this planet is full of additional secrets.<br>A signal is coming from the surface, but the ship's sensors cannot identify it.<br>Go there and use the features of the exploration vehicle to learn more.<br><br><strong>Have fun in virtual reality</strong><br>VR is fun, and we've added features to make it even more enjoyable!<br>A machine for printing and storing photos in the ship<br>A training space for bait shooting<br>Moveable furniture<br>And many other things!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/cff6ee7e17dec22a6d27252bc27ab337.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/cff6ee7e17dec22a6d27252bc27ab337.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/cff6ee7e17dec22a6d27252bc27ab337.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Embark on a scientific mission</strong><br>Congratulations photographer, you have been selected to participate in the exploration of the exoplanet Gliese 486B.<br>Your mission is to catalogue all the dinosaurs and other primitive creatures that live on this exoplanet.<br><br>Professor Edmee, in charge of the expedition, will be your supervisor on site and will give you your objectives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/64049f07aa32a4aae46fefb5ec24cf3e.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/64049f07aa32a4aae46fefb5ec24cf3e.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/64049f07aa32a4aae46fefb5ec24cf3e.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Photograph, catalogue, interact</strong><br>Your photos will allow us to learn more about this planet but also about the dinosaurs that lived on Earth.<br><br>Interact with the fauna to take the best pictures and discover all their behaviors.<br><br>All data will be entered into the <strong>Dinopedia</strong>.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take photos of the dinosaurs<br></li><li>Interact with the dinosaurs to see their reactions<br></li><li>Complete the &quot;Dinopedia&quot; encyclopedia<br></li><li>Find paths to new areas<br></li><li>Discover and solve the mysteries of the planet!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/69d16820f46e03fff64448aac229b586.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/69d16820f46e03fff64448aac229b586.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/69d16820f46e03fff64448aac229b586.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A peaceful mission!</strong><br>No weapons are allowed on this mission.<br>In case of danger, your vehicle will automatically leave the area to avoid any risky situations.<br>You can therefore stroll peacefully, but beware: some dinosaurs may chase after you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/ac49a21d0c9f69a7de816c1a9ebec093.poster.avif?t=1742158711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/ac49a21d0c9f69a7de816c1a9ebec093.webm?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1103660/extras/ac49a21d0c9f69a7de816c1a9ebec093.mp4?t=1742158711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A planet full of mysteries</strong><br>It seems that this planet is full of additional secrets.<br>A signal is coming from the surface, but the ship's sensors cannot identify it.<br>Go there and use the features of the exploration vehicle to learn more.<br><br><strong>Have fun in virtual reality</strong><br>VR is fun, and we've added features to make it even more enjoyable!<br>A machine for printing and storing photos in the ship<br>A training space for bait shooting<br>Moveable furniture<br>And many other things!",
